{"unit_id":"manhkhiemhoang2-bit__dsh-costcast#feature-estimate","repo":"manhkhiemhoang2-bit/dsh-costcast","commit":"b1b2804c3dce6ee91321b14dac7197da29289e2e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-costcast 的功能「下一步成本区间」：根据下一次请求的上下文规模、本会话缓存命中比例和平均输出量，按内置价格表估算费用上下界，并显示在输入框上方。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/estimate.js:129-150"]}
