{"unit_id":"manhkhiemhoang2-bit__dsh-costcast#caveat-model","repo":"manhkhiemhoang2-bit/dsh-costcast","commit":"b1b2804c3dce6ee91321b14dac7197da29289e2e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-costcast 使用前须知：客户端把计价模型固定为 deepseek-flash，未从当前会话读取模型名，因此使用其他模型时估算价格可能不匹配（见 src/component.js:16）。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/component.js:16"]}
